# Open 25.1
tags: open, benchmark, 2025
stimulus: Ascending couplet with a lunge built in; the rounds get long fast.
note: Add 3 reps to the burpees and hang clean-to-overheads after each round; the ladder written here (3-6-9-...) simply continues until the cap. The lunge is 30 ft per round (2 x 15 ft), each 15 ft section counting as 1 rep; no partial credit at the cap.
3-6-9-12-15-18-21-24-27-30-33-36-39-42-45-48-51-54-57-60
  Burpee ("lateral over the dumbbell")
  Dumbbell hang clean-to-overhead 50/35 lb
  9.14 m Lunge

Scaled:
  Dumbbell hang clean-to-overhead 35/20 lb
